column87:
As someone relatively new to Rails who is working on a "near" realtime system this was great, thanks for the article.<p>Wanted to point out that you can simplify your "folder count updating" code by using a relatively unused jQuery function: ".load" [1].<p><pre><code>  $.get($section.attr('data-url'))
    .success(function (response) {
      $section.html(response);
    });
</code></pre>
would become<p><pre><code>  $section.load($section.data('url'));
</code></pre>
[1] <a href="http://jqapi.com/#p=load" rel="nofollow">http://jqapi.com/#p=load</a>
